@@ CyclicAlgorithm - Test 3: Loop algorithm with For-To-Next cycles
@@ Variant: Laboyko Valeriy Valeriyovych
@@ Language: L15

#Program LOOP;
Variable A, B, I, J, X, SQR
Start

@@ 1. Input two numbers A and B (A < B)
Get(A);
Get(B);

@@ 2. Simple loop: output squares from A to B
For I >> A To B
    SQR >> I Mul I;
    Put(SQR);
Next I;

@@ 3. Nested loop: calculate X = A * B
@@ X = 0
@@ For I = 1 to A
@@     For J = 1 to B
@@         X = X + 1
X >> 0;
For I >> 1 To A
    For J >> 1 To B
        X >> X + 1;
    Next J;
Next I;

@@ 4. Output result X
Put(X);

Stop
